        "original_id": "f822a623-6e64-5480-8f32-f0727f927ef7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lin-Manuel Miranda\n- Films: Cars 2, Cars, Cars 3, Mary Poppins Returns\n- Characters: Lightning McQueen\n- Companies: Pixar Animation Studios, Walt Disney Pictures, Disney\n- Works: Hamilton, In the Heights, Moana soundtrack, Cars Toons\n\nFacts:\n- Lin-Manuel Miranda was born on January 16, 1980, and he is an American composer, lyricist, playwright, and actor.\n- Lightning McQueen is an anthropomorphic stock car character in the animated Pixar film Cars (2006).\n- Cars 2 is a 2011 American computer-animated action comedy spy film produced by Pixar Animation Studios for Walt Disney Pictures.\n- Lightning McQueen appears in Cars 2 (2011).\n- Lin-Manuel Miranda is best known for creating and starring in the Broadway musicals Hamilton and In the Heights.\n- Lin-Manuel Miranda co-wrote the songs for Disney's Moana soundtrack (2016).\n- Lightning McQueen appears in Cars 3 (2017) and in the TV shorts known as Cars Toons.\n- Lin-Manuel Miranda is set to star in Disney's upcoming film Mary Poppins Returns.",
